member.summary:
Parses attribute declarations and specifications.
Format 1: attribute attr_name : type;
Format 2: attribute attr_name of target : class is value;

Parses a component or direct-entity instantiation. Handles three real-
world syntaxes:
  inst : Comp port map(...);
  inst : entity work.Sub port map(...);
  inst : entity work.Sub(arch_name) port map(...);
